{
  "sequence_id": "seq_0ef2ec294597f572",
  "texts": [
    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Hey, go easy, man. He holds a mean grudge."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "!??!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "REALLY."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T4",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "HE WANTS WHAT YOU'VE GOT."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T5",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "It's the blonde hair and green eyes that does it."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T6",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Guess you're safe, then."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T7",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Later, man."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T8",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "What have"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T9",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Ash."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T10",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Just don't put me in the position of having to kill you."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T11",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "WOW--? You been watching old movies, shorter?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "\"Varrmmm!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "GOES WITH THE BALD SPOTS, MAN!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Ha, ha! That was some corny shit, huh?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "but, uh... you DO know it's just shaved, right?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T5",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Hand-bags"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T6",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Tok TOK"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T7",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "WHO IS IT?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T8",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "It's me, skip. Open up."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Chak"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "!!?!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Welcome home, boss. You early."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T5",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "ANYTHING HAPPEN?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T6",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Same ol, same old."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T7",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Pop? Corn"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T8",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Hmm."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T9",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "him, too."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T10",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Good."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T11",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Kreek"
    }
  ],
